[5.537498, "o", "       ██╗  ██╗███████╗ ██████╗ ███████╗\r\n       ██║ ██╔╝██╔════╝██╔═══██╗██╔════╝\r\n       █████╔╝ █████╗  ██║   ██║███████╗\r\n       ██╔═██╗ ██╔══╝  ██║   ██║╚════██║\r\n       ██║  ██╗███████╗╚██████╔╝███████║\r\n       ╚═╝  ╚═╝╚══════╝ ╚═════╝ ╚══════╝\r\n"]
[5.537672, "o", "\r\n       keosctl v1.0.1 — Autonomous SRE Agent CLI · by Pocteo Platform\r\n\r\nUSAGE\r\n  keosctl <command> [options]\r\n\r\nINSTALL + LIFECYCLE\r\n  install                       Interactive 6-step wizard (recommended)\r\n  install --headless [flags]    Non-interactive install (CI / scripted)\r\n  uninstall [--keep-pvcs]       Remove the Keos release\r\n  link [path]                   Symlink keosctl to a PATH dir (default ~/.local/bin)\r\n\r\nOPERATIONS\r\n  status [--watch] [--json]     Release + pods + agent mode summary\r\n  doctor                        Health check across every component\r\n  mode [obs|active|frozen]      Print or set the agent mode\r\n  logs <component> [-f]         Tail pod logs (api/mcp-server/frontend/…)\r\n  ui [--port N]                 Port-forward + open the SPA in your browser\r\n  token                         Print the bearer token\r\n  restart <component>           Rollout restart a component\r\n  shell <component>             Interactive bash/sh inside a pod\r\n  describe <component>          kubectl describe of a Keos pod\r\n  port-forward <component> <p>  Generic kubectl port-forward\r\n  upgrade [--chart-version v]   helm upgrade the Keos release\r\n"]
[5.537731, "o", "\r\nAGENT\r\n  events [-n N] [--watch]       List recent incidents (colored by outcome)\r\n  usecases list|show            List or show use case definitions\r\n  run <use-case-slug>           Trigger a use case end-to-end\r\n  audit tail [-n N]             Tail the HMAC-signed audit log\r\n  audit verify                  Verify the HMAC chain integrity\r\n\r\nDATA\r\n  seed                          Re-seed the runbook corpus into Qdrant\r\n  models list                   List installed LLM models\r\n  models pull <model>           Pull a new LLM into Ollama\r\n  models rm <model>             Remove an LLM\r\n\r\nDATA LIFECYCLE\r\n  backup [-o path] [--include-models]   Tarball audit + qdrant + helm values + CR\r\n"]
